{
  "id": "the-weary-blues",
  "title": "The Weary Blues",
  "author": "Langston Hughes",
  "year": "1926",
  "note": "Bite-sized ritual sit — Proem · The Weary Blues · Jazzonia.\n\nHarlem, late night—a piano that won’t quit, and a young poet listening hard. Langston Hughes’s 1926 first book opens with Proem (“I am a Negro”), then the title poem and a short run of cabaret pieces. Blues and jazz aren’t decoration here; they’re the beat the lines move to.",
  "minutes": 5,
  "cover": "",
  "coverAlt": "",
  "scenes": [
    {
      "id": "sit-0",
      "title": "Proem · The Weary Blues",
      "place": "one sitting",
      "reentry": "Black as the night is black,",
      "prompt": "A word from this stretch."
    }
  ],
  "breaths": [
    {
      "id": "sit-0-0",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "I am a Negro:"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-1",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "Black as the night is black,"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-2",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "Black like the depths of my Africa."
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-3",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "I’ve been a slave:"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-4",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "Caesar told me to keep his door-steps clean."
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-5",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "I brushed the boots of Washington."
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-6",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "I’ve been a worker:"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-7",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "Under my hand the pyramids arose."
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-8",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "I made mortar for the Woolworth Building."
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-9",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "I’ve been a singer:"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-10",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "All the way from Africa to Georgia"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-11",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "I carried my sorrow songs."
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-12",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "I made ragtime."
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-13",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "I’ve been a victim:"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-14",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "The Belgians cut off my hands in the Congo."
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-15",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "They lynch me now in Texas."
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-16",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "I am a Negro:"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-17",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "Black as the night is black,"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-18",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "Black like the depths of my Africa."
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-19",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "THE WEARY BLUES"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-20",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "Droning a drowsy syncopated tune,"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-21",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "Rocking back and forth to a mellow croon,"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-22",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "I heard a Negro play."
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-23",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "Down on Lenox Avenue the other night"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-24",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "By the pale dull pallor of an old gas light"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-25",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "He did a lazy sway...."
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-26",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "He did a lazy sway...."
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-27",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "To the tune o’ those Weary Blues."
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-28",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "With his ebony hands on each ivory key"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-29",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "He made that poor piano moan with melody."
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-30",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "O Blues!"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-31",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "Swaying to and fro on his rickety stool"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-32",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "He played that sad raggy tune like a musical fool."
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-33",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "Sweet Blues!"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-34",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "Coming from a black man’s soul."
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-35",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "O Blues!"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-36",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "In a deep song voice with a melancholy tone"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-37",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "I heard that Negro sing, that old piano moan—"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-38",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "“Ain’t got nobody in all this world,"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-39",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "Ain’t got nobody but ma self."
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-40",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "I’s gwine to quit ma frownin’"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-41",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "And put ma troubles on the shelf.”"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-42",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "Thump, thump, thump, went his foot on the floor."
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-43",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "He played a few chords then he sang some more—"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-44",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "“I got the Weary Blues"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-45",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "And I can’t be satisfied."
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-46",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "Got the Weary Blues"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-47",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "And can’t be satisfied—"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-48",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "I ain’t happy no mo’"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-49",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "And I wish that I had died.”"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-50",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "And far into the night he crooned that tune."
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-51",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "The stars went out and so did the moon."
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-52",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "The singer stopped playing and went to bed"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-53",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "While the Weary Blues echoed through his head."
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-54",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "He slept like a rock or a man that’s dead."
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-55",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "JAZZONIA"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-56",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "Oh, silver tree!"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-57",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "Oh, shining rivers of the soul!"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-58",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "In a Harlem cabaret"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-59",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "Six long-headed jazzers play."
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-60",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "A dancing girl whose eyes are bold"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-61",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "Lifts high a dress of silken gold."
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-62",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "Oh, singing tree!"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-63",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "Oh, shining rivers of the soul!"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-64",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "Were Eve’s eyes"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-65",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "In the first garden"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-66",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "Just a bit too bold?"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-67",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "Was Cleopatra gorgeous"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-68",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "In a gown of gold?"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-69",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "Oh, shining tree!"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-70",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "Oh, silver rivers of the soul!"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-71",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "In a whirling cabaret"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-72",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "Six long-headed jazzers play."
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-73",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "NEGRO DANCERS"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-74",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "“Me an’ ma baby’s"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-75",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "Got two mo’ ways,"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-76",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "Two mo’ ways to do de buck!"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-77",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "Da, da,"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-78",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "Da, da, da!"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-79",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "Two mo’ ways to do de buck!”"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-80",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "Soft light on the tables,"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-81",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "Music gay,"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-82",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "Brown-skin steppers"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-83",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "In a cabaret."
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-84",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "White folks, laugh!"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-85",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "White folks, pray!"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-86",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "“Me an’ ma baby’s"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-87",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "Got two mo’ ways,"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-88",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "Two mo’ ways to do de buck!”"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-89",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "YOUNG SINGER"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-90",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "One who sings “chansons vulgaires”"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-91",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "In a Harlem cellar"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-92",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "Where the jazz-band plays"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-93",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "From dark to dawn"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-94",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "Would not understand"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-95",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "Should you tell her"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-96",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "That she is like a nymph"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-97",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "For some wild faun."
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-98",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "CABARET"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-99",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "Does a jazz-band ever sob?"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-100",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "They say a jazz-band’s gay."
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-101",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "Yet as the vulgar dancers whirled"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-102",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "And the wan night wore away,"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-103",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "One said she heard the jazz-band sob"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-104",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "When the little dawn was grey."
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-105",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "TO MIDNIGHT NAN AT LEROY’S"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-106",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "Strut and wiggle,"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-107",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "Shameless gal."
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-108",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "Wouldn’t no good fellow"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-109",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "Be your pal."
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-110",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "_Hear dat music...."
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-111",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "Jungle night."
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-112",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "Hear dat music...."
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-113",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "And the moon was white._"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-114",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "Sing your Blues song,"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-115",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "Pretty baby."
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-116",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "You want lovin’"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-117",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "And you don’t mean maybe."
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-118",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "_Jungle lover...."
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-119",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "Night black boy...."
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-120",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "Two against the moon"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-121",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "And the moon was joy._"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-122",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "Strut and wiggle,"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-123",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "Shameless Nan."
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-124",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "Wouldn’t no good fellow"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-125",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "Be your man."
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-126",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "HARLEM NIGHT CLUB"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-127",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "Sleek black boys in a cabaret."
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-128",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "Jazz-band, jazz-band,—"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-129",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "Play, plAY, PLAY!"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-130",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "Tomorrow....who knows?"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-131",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "Dance today!"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-132",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "White girls’ eyes"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-133",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "Call gay black boys."
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-134",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "Black boys’ lips"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-135",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "Grin jungle joys."
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-136",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "Dark brown girls"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-137",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "In blond men’s arms."
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-138",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "Jazz-band, jazz-band,—"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-139",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "Sing Eve’s charms!"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-140",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "White ones, brown ones,"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-141",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "What do you know"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-142",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "About tomorrow"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-143",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "Where all paths go?"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-144",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "Jazz-boys, jazz-boys,—"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-145",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "Play, plAY, PLAY!"
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-146",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "Tomorrow....is darkness."
    },
    {
      "id": "sit-0-147",
      "sceneId": "sit-0",
      "text": "Joy today!"
    }
  ]
}
